{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00269",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 3.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a few minutes behind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.5,
      "end_seconds": 14.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "It's burning in both feet, mostly. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.22,
      "end_seconds": 18.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.75,
      "end_seconds": 29.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "About... well, about a month. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.02,
      "end_seconds": 41.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.79,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.16,
      "end_seconds": 47.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Only walking around, and it's not much. Bedsheets touching them definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.57,
      "end_seconds": 50.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.34,
      "end_seconds": 56.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.19,
      "end_seconds": 61.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you had any hand symptoms, back pain or foot ulcers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.19,
      "end_seconds": 65.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.6,
      "end_seconds": 70.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.0,
      "end_seconds": 73.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.34,
      "end_seconds": 77.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.28,
      "end_seconds": 79.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.74,
      "end_seconds": 88.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.97,
      "end_seconds": 90.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Nothing, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.83,
      "end_seconds": 95.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.31,
      "end_seconds": 97.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.1,
      "end_seconds": 113.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.64,
      "end_seconds": 124.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "Yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.71,
      "end_seconds": 138.19,
      "duration_seconds": 12.48,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.88,
      "end_seconds": 142.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.79,
      "end_seconds": 145.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.92,
      "end_seconds": 149.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.85,
      "end_seconds": 151.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.89,
      "end_seconds": 166.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Alright, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.95,
      "end_seconds": 189.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.7 degrees, pulse is 70 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air. And BP is 111 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.94,
      "end_seconds": 192.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Is that alright, you know, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.15,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.6,
      "end_seconds": 211.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "Uh, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.94,
      "end_seconds": 231.9,
      "duration_seconds": 18.96,
      "text": "So, based on your history, I think we're dealing with peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning in both feet for about a month, and no hand symptoms or back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.85,
      "end_seconds": 234.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.94,
      "end_seconds": 238.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.18,
      "end_seconds": 239.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.22,
      "end_seconds": 265.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'd like to arrange a nerve conduction study for neuropathy. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.97,
      "end_seconds": 266.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.8,
      "end_seconds": 290.46,
      "duration_seconds": 22.66,
      "text": "I'd like you to take pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night, for four weeks. That's for nerve pain. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Check your feet every evening for cuts or blisters, you may not feel them. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.66,
      "end_seconds": 303.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.56,
      "text": "I'd like you to see podiatry as well, and I'll write the referral. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.93,
      "end_seconds": 306.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "So, yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.29,
      "end_seconds": 312.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.2,
      "end_seconds": 313.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.74,
      "end_seconds": 323.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.67,
      "end_seconds": 331.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "So, I take the pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.06,
      "end_seconds": 337.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.53,
      "end_seconds": 343.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.7,
      "end_seconds": 345.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}